    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "body": "## Goal\nImplement the Import as project onboarding flow using the backend validation and Git-preparation API from [#4755](https://github.com/Untrivial-ai/agent-orchestrator/issues/4755).\n\n## Scope\n- Update CreateProjectFlow to call POST /imports/validate immediately after the user selects a folder with importKind: project.\n- Block all downstream onboarding until validation completes.\n- If isValid is false or nextStep is error, show blockingErrors and do not show the next onboarding modal.\n- If nextStep is continue, proceed with the existing project creation flow.\n- If nextStep is prepare_git, show a Git preparation modal for the root repository.\n- Show detected Git state, only the missing Git steps, an editable remote URL, Back, and Continue.\n- On Continue, call POST /imports/prepare-git and show per-step progress from GitPreparationEvent.\n- Run the displayed steps sequentially in the UI: do not show the next action as running until the prior action succeeds.\n- On failure, show the failed step with retry and back actions.\n\n## Special Project Choice\nWhen validation returns nextStep: choose_import_kind because the root is not Git-initialized but child repositories exist, show an informational choice:\n- Try importing as workspace: return to import-type selection while retaining the selected folder.\n- Continue as project: continue using the root only.\n\nDo not present child repositories as targets for Git preparation in the project flow.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Non-Git root shows git_init, git_commit, and set_remote.\n- Git root without a commit or origin shows git_commit and set_remote only.\n- Git root with a commit but no origin shows set_remote only.\n- Blocking errors stop onboarding before harness selection.\n- The workspace suggestion choice appears only for the non-Git-root-with-child-repositories case.\n- Component tests cover ready, blocked, preparation-required, workspace suggestion, progress success, and progress failure states.\n\n## Dependency\n- [#4755](https://github.com/Untrivial-ai/agent-orchestrator/issues/4755)",
